node_modules/
# Built assets under web/dist/ are TRACKED (see Option B in the fresh-
# machine fix batch): committing them means `cargo build --release` on
# a fresh clone serves the real dashboard with NO npm step required.
# The CI freshness gate (.github/workflows/ci.yml) rebuilds the assets
# on every PR and fails if the committed dist differs — that's what
# keeps them from going stale.
.svelte-kit/
*.log
